<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Allen Shao · 文章集</title><description>Allen Shao 的技术写作：AI 大模型、Agent 架构、云安全与企业实践。连载《从对话到协作》14 章，另有单篇《工程师 Agentic Coding 的一天》。</description><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/</link><language>zh-cn</language><item><title>总览：从对话到协作</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/overview/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/overview/</guid><description>把 2022.11 到 2026.01 的模型、协议与产品放回同一条演进线上，看清每一次能力跃迁解决了什么问题，又留下了什么新问题。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Feb 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>序章</category></item><item><title>用一家餐厅，理解 AI 系统</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/restaurant-analogy/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/restaurant-analogy/</guid><description>用「智能餐厅」拆解 AI 系统的四层结构：顾客、服务团队、后厨与工具层。理解推理层为什么是核心差异。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>导读</category></item><item><title>2022：生成式 AI 的觉醒</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2022/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2022/</guid><description>InstructGPT 用 RLHF 把「有能力」变成「听得懂」，ChatGPT 五天破百万，4K 上下文时代开启。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>时间线</category></item><item><title>2023：长文本元年与百模大战</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2023/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2023/</guid><description>Claude 2 把上下文推到 100K，GPT-4 与 Plugins 打开工具生态，Prompt 工程师成为年薪 20 万美元的新职业。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>时间线</category></item><item><title>2024：推理革命与生态标准化</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2024/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2024/</guid><description>OpenAI o1 打开推理范式，MCP 试图标准化工具调用，Prompt Caching 与 DeepSeek-V3 把成本推向主战场。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>时间线</category></item><item><title>2025：生态爆发与范式转移</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2025/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2025/</guid><description>DeepSeek-R1 开源推理，Sonnet 4.5 与 Opus 4.5 把上下文和编程能力推到新高度，Agent Skills 成为架构级创新。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>时间线</category></item><item><title>2026：协作时代的开启</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2026/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/year-2026/</guid><description>Claude Cowork 与 Clawdbot 把多 Agent 协作推到台前，云本分化与个人 AI 成为新的变量。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>时间线</category></item><item><title>上下文革命：从 4K 到 2M</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/context-revolution/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/context-revolution/</guid><description>三年 500 倍。长上下文解决了遗忘，也把成本、延迟与信息噪音推到新的量级，并催生缓存、压缩与检索三条优化路径。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>技术深潜</category><category>深度</category></item><item><title>Prompt 工程的兴衰</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/prompt-engineering/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/prompt-engineering/</guid><description>从年薪 20 万美元到职位缩减 70%，Prompt 工程从用户侧下沉到系统侧：System Prompt、工具描述与 Skills 成为新的载体。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>技术深潜</category><category>速览</category></item><item><title>MCP 协议：从炒作到现实</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/mcp/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/mcp/</guid><description>MCP 解决了「AI 能连什么」，但 Token 效率、安全边界与企业级治理仍是现实问题。它是能力层，不是智慧层。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>技术深潜</category><category>速览</category></item><item><title>Agent Skills：比 MCP 更重要的创新</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/agent-skills/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/agent-skills/</guid><description>Skills 补的不是模型能力，而是架构：把团队最佳实践沉淀为可复用、可版本化的知识包，Token 更省，边界更清晰。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>技术深潜</category><category>深度</category></item><item><title>AI 进化的新范式：推理层才是核心</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/new-paradigm/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/new-paradigm/</guid><description>参数不是唯一的护城河。推理层决定模型如何被调度、约束与优化，也决定了同样能力下的成本、可靠性与体验差距。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>洞察</category><category>深度</category></item><item><title>企业 AI 平台发展史（2023—2026）</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/enterprise-case/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/enterprise-case/</guid><description>一个企业 AI 平台从 POC 走到 4000+ 用户：快速跟进、私有模型、渐进式演进与成本治理，构成一条可复用的落地路径。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>实践</category></item><item><title>未来展望与结论</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/outlook/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/ai-evolution/outlook/</guid><description>Skills 生态、云本分化、小模型、开源追赶与 Agent 自主：从演进规律出发，给出未来三年的判断与行动清单。</description><pubDate>Thu, 29 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>从对话到协作</category><category>展望</category></item><item><title>工程师 Agentic Coding 的一天</title><link>https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/essays/a-day-of-agentic-coding/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://shaominfeng.github.io/blog/essays/a-day-of-agentic-coding/</guid><description>从 09:00 的自动晨报到 18:00 的最后一轮巡检：一个工程师怎样把 AI 嵌进工单、调试、开发、复盘与工具改进，让时间从「排队」变成「重叠」。</description><pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>单篇</category><category>Agentic Coding</category><category>AI 工作流</category><category>工程实践</category></item></channel></rss>